{"id":"659408","name":"焖煎老豆腐","author":"开心肥羊","authorId":"389860","desc":"","cover":"images/659408/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"老豆腐","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜蓉辣椒","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"老豆腐切块，锅烧热后倒入适量油，均匀撒入盐，再把豆腐慢火煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/659408/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"舀入蒜蓉辣酱。","img":"images/659408/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"再加少许生抽。","img":"images/659408/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"以及陈醋。","img":"images/659408/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再加点白砂糖。","img":"images/659408/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入一碗清水，中小火焖煮至汤汁收干即可。","img":"images/659408/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}